/-! ## Constructor lemmas the SF11/DT1 structures never recorded

Sixteen names, and every one is an auto-generated `mk.inj` / `mk.sizeOf_spec`
pair on a structure added by #1416, #1420 or #1421 and given records for its
fields but not its constructor:

    OpenRestrictionFamily.Filtration              LeftDerivedTensor
    OpenRestrictionFamily.Lemma416Part3Data          TensorAcyclicResolution
    OpenRestrictionFamily.NoetherianLocalityData  Slicing.Restriction
    OpenRestrictionFamily.SLocalSlicingData
    OpenRestrictionFamily.TwoDistinctAffineSLocalTStructures

Eight structures, two lemmas each. `Audit completeness` printed fifteen of the
sixteen -- it caps the list -- and the missing entry is
`Slicing.Restriction.mk.sizeOf_spec`, inferred from that pairing rather than
observed. If the inference is wrong the elaborator says `Unknown constant` and
this slice fails to run, which is the same filter that settled the 380 above.

They belong in this slice because it already reaches all three namespaces: it
carries six `LeftDerivedTensor` / `TensorAcyclicResolution` / `Slicing.Restriction`
records today.
-/

